                        </span>
                        <ul class="hc-badges">
                            </ul><span class="hc-date hc-title" title="19th Aug 2026 2:29">3 hours, 16 mins ago</span></div><p class="hc-comment-text">Hi All, new to the site. Looks like a great community. Please RMT.<br>Kinsky<br>Shaw Hume Cala<br>Semenyo mbeumo Palmer shade<br>Isak haaland perdo<br>Bench dab Michell Davis slater <br><br>Aware D is light. Plan is to roll with this for the first 3 -5 game weeks.<br>First concern for me is Shaw just feels like a transfer waiting to happen. Should I downgrade Shaw to a 4m defender and upgrade shade to tzoils and start Michell Or go the other way and downgrade Michell to a 4m defender and upgrade Shaw to maguire or another 5m defender? Any and suggestions welcome.</p></div></div><div class="actions-wrapper"><div class="hc-open-tools"><span class="icon-kebab"></span> <span class="nonvis">Open Controls</span></a></div><ul class="hc-comment-actions mob-hidden"><li class="hc-permalink hc-title"><a href="https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk/2026/08/19/all-you-need-to-know-about-coventrys-4-0m-defenders?hc_page=-1#hc_comment_27682031" class="hc-title" title="Permalink"><span class="icon-permalink"></span> <span class="nonvis">Permalink</span></a></li></ul><div class="hc-login-to-reply"><a href="/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk%2F2026%2F08%2F19%2Fall-you-need-to-know-about-coventrys-4-0m-defenders">Login To Reply</a></div></div></div><ol class="hc-children"><li class="hc-comment-wrapper hc-level-1">
